  charType: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2718c5863d8c65a4aa712d078446307f, type: 2}
  lineTexts:
  - You really brought me some! That's neat!
  - You really still look confused... You still wonder how you got here and what
    you should do now, am I right?
  - You really lost all of your recent memories? You know what? I will try to ask
    around if somebody saw something, and maybe I will figure out where you cam from!
  - Maybe you can ask around too, and even if you wanna go back, you need to get
    used to forest life at least a little bit. But be careful not to run into wolves,
    maybe the lake in the east is a good start to explore!
